title: "PRESTO MCP Server"
abstract: >-
  A typed, sandboxed Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that exposes the
  PRESTO pulsar / radio-astronomy toolchain to LLMs. Every invocation runs
  inside Docker and produces an auditable on-disk manifest.
